The tight corset bodices, accentuating the decollete zone and the free "Empire style" tops, which appeared on the fashion shows of the spring-summer swimsuits in 2018 caused a real sigh of astonishment among these women of fashion. Finally, a trend in beach fashion has come that allows not only to look really elegant, but also to feel comfortable.
Look at how the colors on these photos from the collections of swimwear "spring-summer" 2018 years are matched:
To the sophisticated fashionista, the creators of the beach fashion presented a special surprise - the "retro" style burst into the trends swiftly. Open and closed models in the style of the middle of the last century against the background of modern models look in a particularly refined and exquisite manner.
Fashionable swimsuits for 2018 year
Designers tried to recreate not only the fashionable silhouette of the 50 era, but also the image of the sophisticated and sexy lady of that era. Open shoulders and back in models with a broom girth perfectly reflect this idea.
