It is in the first month of 2016 that the carnival season starts here, it will last more than a month. Everything is all right on the "Archipelago of Eternal Spring" and with the weather - from 20 ° C air, 18 ° C sea.
In some eastern countries, the calendar year begins in March. The brightest events in this regard are waiting for tourists in Bali - it's a pleasure to meet the New Year one more time, when on the street 30 ° C the heat!
At the same time, exotic connoisseurs have a wonderful alternative - Indonesian Bali, where dry and hot weather is finally established (33 ° C air, 30 ° C water). From the resorts of Thailand are available Samui and Pattaya, dry and hot weather throughout Vietnam.
On Crete in June, the Festival of Culture, which lasts about 2 months, opens. In Malta, one of the main holidays of a tiny state is celebrated - the day of Saints Peter and Paul or simply Mnariya.
The end of the calendar summer is a period of dry weather and suffocating heat in all Mediterranean resorts. The air is heated no less than in July, and the sea warms up to maximum 27 ° C, after which it starts to slowly cool down.
In September, the main cultural event of the year in Cyprus is the Kipriya Arts Festival, an event in Limassol that attracts thousands of guests. And in Bali will be an interesting event - an international meditation festival in the town of Ubud.
Hindus loudly celebrate the cessation of showers - across the country is celebrated Diwali, the festival of lights, symbolizing the defeat of the forces of darkness. The most beautiful ceremony of Loi is on 25 November in Thailand.
Warm weather in Europe is over, but the "golden" season takes off in the Arab Emirates, India and throughout Thailand (except for the island of Samui). Although December in these regions is the coldest time of the year, in all resorts the temperature does not fall below 20-25 ° C. Choose these countries for a trip abroad until April-May - the tourist season will continue here until this time.
