A growing abdomen during pregnancy causes the eyes of those around and the pride of the future mummy. However, an increase in the size of the stomach causes not only positive emotions, but also negative feelings that affect the woman's health.
Frightening myths alarm pregnant women and cause fear of using a bandage during pregnancy. But there are situations when a woman needs a supporting element.
The bandage refers to orthopedic adaptations. Allows to support a growing abdomen during pregnancy, without affecting the fetus, promotes the correct location of the baby in the stomach.
If the product is selected correctly, the supporting element:
• removes heaviness in the legs;
• facilitates the movement of women;
There are several types of bandages that differ in their type and purpose.
Prenatal bandage - an indispensable device, greatly facilitating the state of the future mother.
During pregnancy, to support the back, such a bandage is worn, placing its wide part on the back. After childbirth to tighten the abdomen, the bandage changes its location and is worn by the wide part on the peritoneum.
Bandages for pregnant women are issued as:
It is worth considering that the corset for pregnant women refers to the elements of underwear. Therefore, it requires competent care and regular washing.
Basically this process falls on the fourth month. However, the change in the size of the abdomen in each woman is very individual.
Not every pregnant doctor will recommend wearing a bandage. If the muscles are well developed, and after long loads in the form of being on the legs, walking, exercise, there are no unpleasant sensations in the back, abdomen, wearing a bandage simply does not make sense.
Therefore, for pregnant women after 24 weeks, if the fruit is not located head down, wearing a bandage is strictly prohibited.
• when there is a threat of abortion at a later date;
• if a woman's pelvic floor and abdomen muscles are too weak;
• with multiple pregnancies;
It should be borne in mind that nature has all the possibilities to bear fruit without using additional support devices. Without extreme necessity, it is not advisable to resort to such a method.
The decision to use the bandage will have to be taken by the pregnant woman yourself, but the recommendations of the gynecologist should be heeded.
When choosing a bandage, consider that this is a personal intimate article of the wardrobe. Therefore, in this situation, it is not necessary to resort to the help of friends and acquaintances offering to use the thing that has become unnecessary to them.
Gently put on the bandage, tightly fixing it on the body. Do not allow excessive pressure - it will hurt the baby.
When wearing a bandage, observe a number of rules: 1.
2. Take off the bandage at night and during daytime rest.
This unique device is not able to harm neither the future mummy nor the baby, but will help get rid of many negative symptoms present during pregnancy.
The origin and history of the name Klim, the fate of its owner
Because the name itself is: Klim's character and destiny are ambiguous. What does the name Klim mean and what to expect from its owner?
Scientists believe that the shorter word-name came from the long "Clement". And the origin and history of the name Klim are connected with the ancient civilizations of Rome and Greece:
Following the way of Christ, glorifying the mercy of God.
In his youth, Klim becomes impetuous, restless and even unrestrained. He has a hot temper, so Clim is in constant action.
Klim often comes to please his desires, not taking into account the wishes of other people. If his personal interests are affected, he is ready to fight for them to the end, even if the opponent is certainly stronger.
Even if she turns away for a moment, Klim has the patience to wait for favorable circumstances. Moreover, a person with that name himself makes himself and his destiny.
In Klim, credulity and prudence are combined. Because of his tendency to be too open to the world, he often finds himself in unpleasant situations, of which he himself is chosen.
Despite the noble origin and history of the name of the Clim profession, this person is suitable for simple and understandable: agronomist, engineer, animal breeder (little Klimka adores animals, can spend hours with them). He will be very good as an athlete (if you have enough patience), and in the sport of personal high results, and in coaching.
In marriage, Klim needs a woman who is ready to put up with his shortcomings: quick temper, categorical, jealousy and increased love for order. It takes a long time to choose a spouse, otherwise the marriage can fail.
