Ceramic plunger is more reliable
Compared with the metal plunger, the reliability of ceramic plunger is stronger. The precision of the fit between the shaft core and the jacket of the ceramic plunger can reach '±0.001mm' and the finish can reach the mirror effect, thus reducing the friction coefficient and prolonging the service life of the plunger.
The ceramic plunger uses a unique processing means, the surface of the microporous organization has a better smoothness and self-lubricating effect, changing the mechanism of the traditional plunger pump sliding friction and lubrication, can significantly reduce the adverse effects caused by the use of lubricants. Ceramic plunger is more convenient to clean
