Power Rating 54W
* Built-in intelligent algorithm software, to achieve 0.1RPM precise and subtle operation control.
* Micro peristaltic pump uses the original motor, strong and durable, less heat and low noise, the surface increases the corrosion-resistant technology, durable.
* Flow rate and speed are displayed on the same screen, which is more convenient to control.
