-- Microcomputer intelligent control, can display control temperature by liquid crystal display. It also has the function of an over-temperature alarm.
-- Equipped integrated refrigeration system to achieve multi-player protection, the function of non-energy consumption of unconventional automatic frost can avoid the impact on temperature and continuous use of equipment for a long time.
Therefore, we must pay attention to the daily cleaning of the bacterial incubator, and here are XNUMX common cleaning methods for bacteriological incubator:
After removing dirt and debris from the interior and exterior, using low-concentration alcohol to wipe the wall, ventilate for XNUMXminutes and then use ultraviolet light for XNUMXminutes to complete simple disinfection
Under the circumstance that does not have ultraviolet rays illuminate, use XNUMX% ethanol to scrub commonly, and then scrub with XNUMX% bromogeramine, and then use Potassium PermanganateXNUMX:XNUMX ratio for disinfection. It should be noted that, due to the irritating taste, the bottom of the incubator can not be put anything before sterilization, this way is to prevent the solution and corroding the glassware.
The last method is to use disinfectant for sterilization, but bacteriological incubator has sensors to detect temperature and humidity, disinfectant is generally corrosive, which might cause the damage to sensors, so you should be very careful when using a disinfectant. This disinfection method is not recommended.
