Laboratory aspirator is a basic instrument commonly used in biological laboratories, mainly used for suction of residual liquid after various experiments, including waste liquid of cell culture medium, supernatant after centrifugation in centrifugal tube and residual liquid in 96-well plate, etc., it is also a safe collection system to deal with the critical liquid, dangerous pathogens, and any class III or IV biological hazards of waste. Laboratory aspirator application
Waste liquid bottles and adsorption parts can be high temperature and high-pressure sterilization.
