The large capacity CO2 incubator is suitable for a large-scale sample test population, the advantage of a large capacity incubator is that samples can be analyzed in large batches at one time. It is large in size but flexible in function.
The mini CO2 incubator is also called a portable CO2 incubator, and it is mainly used for field analysis, and carries it conveniently. If the laboratory space is limited, and want to improve the space efficiency, or want to culture the sample in a short distance transfer, a mini carbon dioxide incubator is the best choice.
