Pombi yepombi is a device that uses mechanical, chemical, or physical methods to pump the pumped vessel to obtain a vacuum. Generally, vacuum pump is a device to improve, generate and maintain vacuum in a closed space by various methods and is one of the common equipment used in laboratories.
