Here are some advantages of using vacuum pump:
Pombi yepombi structure is simple, manufacturing precision requirements are not high, easy to process. Simple operation and easy maintenance.
Compact structure, the pump is usually directly connected with the motor, and the rotation number is higher. With a smaller structure size, you can get a larger exhaust volume.
There is no metal friction surface in the pump cavity, no need to lubricate the pump.
The temperature change of compressed gas in the pump cavity is very small and can be considered isothermal compression, so it can pump out flammable and explosive gases.
Since there is no exhaust valve and friction surface, it can pump out dusty gas, condensable gas, and gas-water mixture. Types of vacuum pump
