News - BOE made a strong debut at the World Display Industry Conference 2021, leading technology to create an industry vane
BOE made a strong debut at the World Display Industry Conference 2021, leading technology to create an industry vane
Mr. Liu Xiaodong, President of BOE, was invited to attend the opening ceremony of the conference and shared his understanding and thinking on the future development of the display industry in the keynote speech entitled "Infinite Innovation and Boundless Vision" .
Mr. Liu Xiaodong said that in the past, BOE has forged a top-level display road from 0 to 1. As 5G, artificial intelligence, big data and other emerging technologies race to mature, massive data and information need to be exchanged and displayed, which has triggered new demand for display products and brought explosive growth of Internet of Things segmentation scene .
The era of ubiquity has arrived. As the global leader in the field of semiconductor display, BOE has led the display industry in mainland China to achieve a leap from scratch, from a to big , and from large to strong .
Unbounded display is another bright spot in the field of display for BOE. The 65 inch high-definition unbounded display products, whose trilateral border is only 0.9 mm, implementing 99% of the ultra-high screen ratio, which makes the pursuit of screen proportions to an extreme.
The leading flexible AMOLED sliding screen has an external bending radius of only 4mm, and has up to 200,000 dynamic rolling times. Through sliding in and out, the product can be freely converted between mobile phone and tablet without creasing the screen display .
With its leading technological innovation strength and product application capability, BOE has continuously extended the antenna of intelligent display terminals, enabling smart finance, smart retail, smart transportation, smart medical treatment and many other subdivided application scenarios .
