Write your next eBook like George RR Martin with Overtype
Now we can recreate this environment without having to get hold of an old typewriter or leave the comforts of our computer, all thanks to the OverType web.
OverType is a web application which is a typewriter simulator, one of the best typewriter simulators out there. In Overtype we will not only have the font of the letter characteristic of typewriters but we will also have the same operation, with a blank sheet for the background, without any animation and the sound of the keys for each keystroke we make.
Return to classical writing methods is something that attracts a lot of attention, to the point that modern typewriters have come out that cost more than a laptop, something illogical 25 years ago, but now it seems that it is something normal. I personally I stick with simulators like Overtype before with the new typewriters since its operation is just as real and when we do not like it we can return to the classic computer, while with the other typewriters we cannot.
