It is not a question of being alarmist, but if you are still doubting and have not decided whether or not to root your Sony PRS-T2, it is I recommend that you wait a bit before installing the new Sony firmware version 1.0.05.12140.
True that Sony has closed the door that existed on the device to root it and access it with administrator privileges, but only for those cases where the PRS-T2 was not already unprotected. If you've already gotten your hands on the device, you have nothing to worry about, because updating the firmware does not undo the jailbreak; but otherwise it may be advisable to wait, think about it calmly and not install it until you have made a decision about rooting.
