En the screen of the new Sony Reader PRS-T3 may be where we find major improvements and that is now this is high resolution (758 x 1024 pixels). Like the PRS-T2 model, the screen is still E-Ink Pearl and infrared touch.
One of the latest improvements included with respect to the PRS-T2 is the option Quick Charge or fast charge with which we can charge our device to read an eBook in just three minutes.
Buying one or the other is already in your hands ...
