The FBReader ebook reader is an application that was born with the intention of making it easier for the user to read ebooks in their own format, in fb format, but it has quickly incorporated support for other formats such as the epub format or the djvu format, being a useful tool to read ebooks. FBReader It is a multiplatform reader, something that helps us forget to be aware of whether our tablet, computer or laptop is compatible or not with the program, because it will be.
Caliber can read any kind of ebook format, since it is either among the natively supported formats or it can be read through the Caliber plugins. Caliber allows us to read the ebooks in full screen, changing the line spacing, the font, navigate through the chapters, etc ... something useful for many, even those who read manga.
