Azardi is another of those applications that are cross-platform but that stand out in the Gnu / Linux world. This app is fully compatible with Epub version 3, a version that few readers support.
Something that other file readers cannot do. Google Play Books is a great app because it allows a good connection with Google apps and services, but it is also true that it forces us to have this ecosystem and dispense with other online ebook stores that could have the ebook we want or get it for a price less.
