All Kindle They are the most popular devices on the market to read books in digital format, and although it may seem strange, there are still many users who have some of the oldest Amazon eReaders. For example, there are still many who have a Kindle 3 and more and more users are asking us how to restart this device.
Without wasting any more time, below we are going to explain the steps to restart the Kindle 3 quickly and easily:
Press, without pressing, the power button. As usual, we will see the LED light that incorporates this button in green for approximately two seconds.
That will cause the device to reboot completely If you have followed the steps correctly, your Kindle 3 device should have already restarted, but In the event that you have not succeeded, we encourage you to try to follow the same process again, charging your device to 100% beforehand..
