Made of plastic that may look like something else, it has a very elegant black finish and it is practically impossible for someone not to like it. It is quite small in size and is very suitable to store almost anywhere and even to carry in the back pocket of a pair of pants or the inside bag of a jacket.
As usual Amazon does not provide too much data about the inside of its devices so we do not know exactly the processor that mounts this eReader, although we can say about it that is 25% faster than previous e-books. Although it may seem like an unimportant feature, it is noticeable, especially when turning the pages of any book.
Great screen clarity that allows us to read without our eyes marrying even if we spend long periods of time reading
The device offers us enormous speed in almost everything we have to do and, for example, turning the pages is something easy, simple and that does not despair us as it happens in other devices of this type.
Possibilities that Amazon offers us to perform page steps or to consult certain terms in the dictionary of the RAE or in Wikipedia
