Amazon has decided to join the Hispanic festivity and it has done so through the front door. During the last hours, Bezos' company has presented a new eReader model, an eReader with an old name but new and powerful hardware: the new Kindle Oasis
In addition, this shape favors having a second battery that allows a longer duration. The weight of this eReader is 194 grams and has the measurements: 159 mm x 141 mm x 3,4 - 8 mm.
Similar to Amazon's premium models prior to this model, the new Kindle Oasis has a touch screen, complemented by a keypad and backlight with 12 led lights that can be regulated to be able to read the device in any environment. This model has 3G + Wifi, the premium model of Amazon devices.
We are facing a premium eReader model, there is no doubt about this, but personally I think it is a model that it should have been. Namely, this new Kindle Oasis and its new functions should have been the first Kindle Oasis modelWell, we all expected an eReader with a large screen, that is resistant to water or with another special function and of course with a lower price.
