If, like in school, they asked me to give a final grade to this new Kobo Aura H2O Edition, it would be very high, bordering on the outstanding, although to achieve this you need to improve in some aspects something that Kobo will surely achieve with its next devices. This new device is a serious competitor to Amazon's Kindle, and few e-books come close to achieving an A global rating.
This new Kobo Aura H2O Edition 2 is already on sale worldwide, through the official Kobo website and in some of the most important technology stores. Its price is not exactly reduced, looking at 179,99 euros, but we must not forget that we are facing an electronic book with some of the most outstanding characteristics.
