It is a kind of molecule which contains both water and oil-related. The stain which is insoluble in water on dirty clothes is combined with the oil-related base of surfactant, and then dissolved into water with the help of hydrophilic group.
Compared with washing liquid, washing powder can be selected to add a variety of auxiliary ingredients, and it is more alkaline and has better decontamination effect than washing liquid. Although the detergent has a relatively poor decontamination effect in three kinds of products, it does not need to be pre dissolved, which makes it the most convenient to use among the three.
Consumers should choose the appropriate detergent according to the material of clothing and the pollution degree of stains. For dirty clothes, choose heavy scale detergent, at this time, the washing powder is more suitable than washing liquid; For light stained clothes, it is more convenient to wash with washing liquid.
