The occurrence of major epidemics caused by animals and their related products is even more harmful to our countries with large populations and high mobility. Facing these problems, it is the general trend to establish new development concepts and new development ideas to guide the development of animal husbandry.
The animal husbandry management system based on RFID technology has the following advantages:
Inductive data collection is adopted, that is, the current information can be read out by simply shaking the collector on the ear tag attachment at the inspection point, which is simple and convenient to operate.
The ear tag does not need to be wired, easy to install, and the setting of coding and the increase and decrease of inspection points are also simple and convenient.
The system label has a unique ID code, which is durable, and the information cannot be tampered with or copied.
Intelligent tracking and management of each livestock, the source of disease can be traced as soon as an epidemic occurs, so as to achieve timely prevention and control, trace the root cause, and reduce the loss of livestock to the lowest point.
Information management, transparency and timeliness, all levels of managers can simply manage through the network, and quickly inquire about various feeding information.
For animal husbandry and breeding, our country is looking for and formulating corresponding policies and adopting various methods to strengthen animal management in animal husbandry and commerce. Strengthening the control and supervision of animal diseases and the prevention of epidemics not only simplify the management process of livestock farms, but also strengthen the protection of food safety for consumers.
