TubesT allows user to edit part design by rotating part, modifying geometry vector, break line, join lines and drawing wrap etc. For example, to make a part design fit for laser cutting, like the shape in below demonstration, you have to delete the unnecessary tool path and add lead line, or modify the 3D vector at corner position by which it changes the direction of laser head towards corner and avoid collision.
You can create a part with standard shape in TubesT. Part design styles are limited but quick and easy for simple part creation.
Profile Path is to modify the tool path for profile steel of L shape, H shape, C shape etc., for the cut off section is different from closed shape. When import file of profiles, select software will create tool path and lead line for this type of parts.
