How To Judge Metal Sheet Material Quality?
How to judge the quality of laser cutting metal? See that the cutting surface is smooth, with few lines, and no brittle fracture.
How to judge the quality of laser cutting metal? See the slit width.
How to judge the quality of laser cutting metal? The cutting seam has good verticality and small heat affected area.
●High stability: The imported fiber laser is used, which has a compact structure and small volume. It adopts a fixed optical path, with low energy consumption and stable cutting quality.
●The optical path is not restricted, the optical fiber transmission loss is small, and the processing range can be maximized.
●The software can realize the timely processing of various graphics and characters, and is simple and convenient to use.
The widened guide rail support surface further optimizes the rigidity of the bed.
Adopt gantry beam design, light weight, good rigidity, good dynamic performance and stable operation. The fully enclosed dust-proof structure greatly improves the service life of its built-in racks and pinions and linear guides.
The helical tooth type is suitable for various use conditions, dustproof, and ensures long-term high-precision movement;
